  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Buildcraft 搭配 IC2！</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>體驗最完美的 1.7.10 版本！</strong></span><br><br>Buildcraft 與 IC2（工業工藝 2）為繁瑣的任務提供了大量自動化功能。<br>這些附加模組還為遊戲增添了更多內容，例如更好的工具、裝備、機器人等！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><br>請查看<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">下方</span>連結的維基頁面。<br><br></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.industrial-craft.net%252findex.php%253ftitle%253dMain_Page\" rel=\"nofollow\">工業工藝維基</a></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftbuildcraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fMinecraft_Buildcraft_Wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">BuildCraft 維基</a></p><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>使用的所有模組：</strong></span><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/242223\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Calculation (by Towdium)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/222995\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eureka (by AEnterprise)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/243900\" rel=\"nofollow\">IC2 BuildCraft 電源轉換器 - 穩定器模組 (by Ternsip)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/242638\" rel=\"nofollow\">工業工藝 (by Player)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/61811\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildcraft (by CovertJaguar)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/222211\" rel=\"nofollow\">NotEnoughItems (by chicken_bones)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/222213\" rel=\"nofollow\">CodeChickenCore (by chicken_bones)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/267172\" rel=\"nofollow\">MineTogether (by Official_CreeperHost)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/297057\" rel=\"nofollow\">LetsEncryptCraft (by CloudyPSP)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/233140\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildcraft Compat (by buildcraftchildsplay)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/32274\" rel=\"nofollow\">JourneyMap (by techbrew)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/221014\" rel=\"nofollow\">Buildcraft Additions (by AEnterprise)</a></p><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/223094\" rel=\"nofollow\">Inventory Tweaks (by Kobata)</a></p><p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/237167\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Library (by FTB)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/237102\" rel=\"nofollow\">FTB Utilities (by FTB)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/302569\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional Pipes for Buildcraft (by ChatterComa)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/267193\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chunk-Pregenerator (by Speiger)</a><br><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/mc-mods/229876\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterFps (by Guichaguri)</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
